codex
I’ve made the FS-7 variants each stage a new CSV while leaving the other untracked, so both prompts include a comparable cached diff. I’ve also remapped resource IDs in FS-5 and FS-10 to spread changing answers across inventory positions. Next I’m checking the rendered differences and executed gold.
